@getbootstrap_com_docs_5_3_examples_grid
button "Toggle theme (light)" primary
h1 Bootstrap grid examples
text Basic grid layouts to get you familiar with building within the Bootstrap grid system.
text In these examples the .themed-grid-col class is added to the columns to add some theming. This is not a class that is available in Bootstrap by default.
h2 Five grid tiers
text There are five tiers to the Bootstrap grid system, one for each range of devices we support. Each tier starts at a minimum viewport size and automatically applies to the larger devices unless overridden.
row
  text .col-4
  text .col-4
  text .col-4
row
  text .col-sm-4
  text .col-sm-4
  text .col-sm-4
row
  text .col-md-4
  text .col-md-4
  text .col-md-4
row
  text .col-lg-4
  text .col-lg-4
  text .col-lg-4
row
  text .col-xl-4
  text .col-xl-4
  text .col-xl-4
row
  text .col-xxl-4
  text .col-xxl-4
  text .col-xxl-4
h2 Three equal columns
text Get three equal-width columns starting at desktops and scaling to large desktops. On mobile devices, tablets and below, the columns will automatically stack.
row
  text .col-md-4
  text .col-md-4
  text .col-md-4
h2 Three equal columns alternative
text By using the .row-cols-* classes, you can easily create a grid with equal columns.
row
  text .col child of .row-cols-md-3
  text .col child of .row-cols-md-3
  text .col child of .row-cols-md-3
h2 Three unequal columns
text Get three columns starting at desktops and scaling to large desktops of various widths. Remember, grid columns should add up to twelve for a single horizontal block. More than that, and columns start stacking no matter the viewport.
row
  text .col-md-3
  text .col-md-6
  text .col-md-3
h2 Two columns
text Get two columns starting at desktops and scaling to large desktops.
row
  text .col-md-8
  text .col-md-4
h2 Full width, single column
text No grid classes are necessary for full-width elements. warning
h2 Two columns with two nested columns
text Per the documentation, nesting is easy—just put a row of columns within an existing column. This gives you two columns starting at desktops and scaling to large desktops, with another two (equal widths) within the larger column.
text At mobile device sizes, tablets and down, these columns and their nested columns will stack.
row
  col
    text .col-md-8
    row
      text .col-md-6
      text .col-md-6
  text .col-md-4
h2 Mixed: mobile and desktop
text The Bootstrap v5 grid system has six tiers of classes: xs (extra small, this class infix is not used), sm (small), md (medium), lg (large), xl (x-large), and xxl (xx-large). You can use nearly any combination of these classes to create more dynamic and flexible layouts.
text Each tier of classes scales up, meaning if you plan on setting the same widths for md, lg, xl and xxl, you only need to specify md.
row
  text .col-md-8
  text .col-6 .col-md-4
row
  text .col-6 .col-md-4
  text .col-6 .col-md-4
  text .col-6 .col-md-4
row
  text .col-6
  text .col-6
h2 Mixed: mobile, tablet, and desktop
row
  text .col-sm-6 .col-lg-8
  text .col-6 .col-lg-4
row
  text .col-6 .col-sm-4
  text .col-6 .col-sm-4
  text .col-6 .col-sm-4
h2 Gutters
text With .gx-* classes, the horizontal gutters can be adjusted.
row
  text .col with .gx-4 gutters
  text .col with .gx-4 gutters
  text .col with .gx-4 gutters
  text .col with .gx-4 gutters
  text .col with .gx-4 gutters
  text .col with .gx-4 gutters
text Use the .gy-* classes to control the vertical gutters.
row
  text .col with .gy-4 gutters
  text .col with .gy-4 gutters
  text .col with .gy-4 gutters
  text .col with .gy-4 gutters
  text .col with .gy-4 gutters
  text .col with .gy-4 gutters
text With .g-* classes, the gutters in both directions can be adjusted.
row
  text .col with .g-3 gutters
  text .col with .g-3 gutters
  text .col with .g-3 gutters
  text .col with .g-3 gutters
  text .col with .g-3 gutters
  text .col with .g-3 gutters
h2 Containers
text Additional classes added in Bootstrap v4.4 allow containers that are 100% wide until a particular breakpoint. v5 adds a new xxl breakpoint.
text .container
text .container-sm
text .container-md
text .container-lg
text .container-xl
text .container-xxl
text .container-fluid
